# Firebase configuration
# NOTE (F50, .claude/audits/FIXES.md): google-services.json is intentionally left
# untracked here, unlike the equivalent web config (VITE_firebaseConfig.ts, which IS
# committed — Firebase web/Android client config isn't a secret by itself; access is
# enforced by Firestore rules/App Check, not by hiding these values). It's kept out of
# git specifically because it's generated per-developer from the Firebase console and
# tends to drift/duplicate across local setups; committing a stale or wrong one silently
# breaks `google-services` plugin builds for everyone else. Any dev building android/
# must download their own copy from the Firebase console (Project settings > Android
# app) and drop it at android/app/google-services.json before `./gradlew assembleDebug`
# / `npx cap run android` will work.
google-services.json
android/app/google-services.json

# Android release keystore
*.keystore
key
keyid
keyid.pub

# Sentry Config File
sentry.properties
sentry-wizard.exe
.sentryclirc
scripts/ornate-compass-478504-e1-firebase-adminsdk-fbsvc-b421e3c5e1.json

